    <h1 class="mkt-hero__title" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mkt-hero__subtitle" style="max-width: 36rem;">
      Plain-language terms for a plain-language product. We've done our best to make
      this clear, fair, and easy to understand.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Content -->
<div class="mkt-section bg-white">
  <div class="mkt-inner--narrow">

    <div class="mkt-highlight-box mkt-highlight-box--blue" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      By accessing or using Todo-it, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy.
      If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access the service.
    </div>

    <div class="mkt-prose">

      <h2>1. Service Description</h2>

      <h3>1.1 What We Provide</h3>
      <p>
        Todo-it is a self-managed productivity application that allows you to organise your life with pages and todos. Our service includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>A 7-day free trial with full access to all features</li>
        <li>Unlimited pages and todos during your trial</li>
        <li>Multiple themes and customisation options</li>
        <li>Data export functionality</li>
        <li>A one-time purchase option to download the app to your device</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>1.2 Our Philosophy</h3>
      <p>
        Todo-it is built on the principle of data sovereignty. After purchase, you own your data
        and can use the app completely offline. We don't track your usage or collect analytics.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Trial Terms</h2>

      <h3>2.1 Free Trial</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Your 7-day free trial begins when you create an account</li>
        <li>Full access to all features during the trial period</li>
        <li>No credit card required to start your trial</li>
        <li>Unlimited pages and todos during trial</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2.2 Trial Expiration</h3>
      <p>When your trial expires:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You will lose access to your account and data</li>
        <li>Your data is retained for 7 days to allow purchase</li>
        <li>After 7 days, your data will be permanently deleted</li>
        <li>You can purchase the app any time before data deletion</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="mkt-highlight-box mkt-highlight-box--amber">
        <strong>Important:</strong> We will send you email reminders before your trial expires.
        It's your responsibility to purchase the app if you want to keep your data.
      </div>

      <h2>3. Purchase and Download</h2>

      <h3>3.1 One-Time Purchase</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>One-time payment of $9.99 (no recurring charges)</li>
        <li>Download the app to your device for offline use</li>
        <li>Complete ownership of your data</li>
        <li>No monthly or annual subscriptions</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>3.2 Download Rights</h3>
      <p>After purchase, you can:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Download the app to up to 3 devices you own</li>
        <li>Use the app completely offline</li>
        <li>Export and import your data</li>
        <li>Customise the app to your preferences</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>3.3 Refund Policy</h3>
      <p>
        We offer a 7-day money-back guarantee. If Todo-it isn't right for you,
        contact us at <a href="mailto:support@todo-it.app">support@todo-it.app</a> within 7 days
        of purchase for a full refund, no questions asked.
      </p>

      <h2>4. User Responsibilities</h2>

      <h3>4.1 Account Security</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep your login credentials secure</li>
        <li>Don't share your account with others</li>
        <li>Notify us immediately of any security breaches</li>
        <li>Use a strong, unique password</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>4.2 Acceptable Use</h3>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the service for illegal activities</li>
        <li>Attempt to hack or compromise our systems</li>
        <li>Share inappropriate or harmful content</li>
        <li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>4.3 Data Backup</h3>
      <p>
        While we maintain backups of your data during the trial period, you are responsible
        for backing up your important information. We provide export functionality for this purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>

      <h3>5.1 Our Rights</h3>
