        including without limitation, loss of profits, data, use, goodwill, or other intangible losses.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Termination</h2>

      <h3>8.1 Account Termination</h3>
      <p>
        You may terminate your account at any time through the settings page.
        We may terminate or suspend your account if you violate these terms.
      </p>

      <h3>8.2 Effect of Termination</h3>
      <p>
        Upon termination, your right to use the service will cease immediately.
        We will retain your data for 7 days to allow you to export it,
