      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:</p>
      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 0.5rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;">
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #374151;">
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@todo-it.app">legal@todo-it.app</a><br>
